      <p><strong>Special provisions for Russian citizens.</strong> As of now, Russian citizens can travel to Italy, but the regulations have become significantly stricter. They must apply for a Schengen visa valid for a single entry only, as the European Union has suspended visa facilitation agreements and no longer issues multiple-entry visas.</p>

